            <p class="font-semibold">How do monthly subscriptions work?</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-white/80">Pick a plan, add your vehicle(s), and use our app to book or drive up. Your plate or QR code unlocks member lanes. Cancel anytime in one tap.</p>
